&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; text-align: left; text-indent: -60px"&gt;（注）１．&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;「&lt;/span&gt;当期末残高&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;」&lt;/span&gt;欄の（内書）は&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;、&lt;/span&gt;１年内償還予定の金額であります&lt;span style="font-family: &amp;apos;Times New Roman&amp;apos;"&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
